      "Title": "Topic",
      "Type": "Summary"
    },
    {
      "Text": "This update for google-cloud-sap-agent fixes the following issue:\n\n- CVE-2026-41178: go.opentelemetry.io/otel/baggage: no rejection of raw-length headers in baggage parsing allows for DoS\n  via oversized inputs (bsc#1276667).\n",
